[00:03.40] Given the chance
[00:05.84] I'll die like a baby
[02:23.32] On some far away beach
[02:27.78] When the season's over.
[02:35.66] Unlikely
[02:37.56] I'll be remembered
[02:42.52] As the tide brushes sand in my eyes
[02:47.22] I'll drift away.
[02:53.36] Cast up on a plateau
[02:57.44] With only one memory
[03:01.76] A single syllable
[03:07.70] Oh lie low lie low.
